<title>USA: Oxnard UHSD, Calif., won by BancAmerica Sec..</title>
<headline>Oxnard UHSD, Calif., won by BancAmerica Sec..</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>BancAmerica Sec. said it won $10 million of Oxnard UHSD, Calif., general obligation bonds, Election 1996, Series B, with a true interest cost of 5.80 percent.</p>
</text>
